# SwiftUI Architecture & Performance Rules

- Prefer iOS 17+ `@Observable` over legacy `ObservableObject` / `@Published`.
- Never execute database queries, network requests, or expensive sorting in `var body: some View`.
- Use `.task(id:)` instead of `.onAppear` for asynchronous work.
- Use `NavigationStack` with type-safe `.navigationDestination(for:)`.
